'''Odexar''' is a trophy fisher in {{zone|Scarleton}}. He is involved in the [[Mage Faction]] [[Crimson Isle Main Questline|Questline]].

== Quest ==
'''Odexar''' asks the player to take a {{Item|Volcanic Stonefish}} to {{NPCSprite|Odger}}. Odger will ask the player to fish up a new {{Item|Volcanic Stonefish}}, as the one '''Odexar''' fished up was damaged. The player must give Odger their {{Item|Volcanic Stonefish}}, and in return they will get a {{Item|Framed Volcanic Stonefish}} to return to '''Odexar'''. After returning the Framed Volcanic Stonefish to '''Odexar''', the player will receive {{Reputation|mage|100}} and {{Coins|80}}.

